      },
      "text": "Section 1. Creation o f Emergency Board. There is created, effective May 5, \n1990, a board of three members to be appointed by the President to investigate \nthe disputes. No member shall be pecuniarily or otherwise interested in any \norganization of railroad employees or any railroad carrier. The board shall \nperform its functions subject to the availability of funds."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2229,
      "char_start": 2141,
