        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1990-05-08/pdf/FR-1990-05-08.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. Report. The board shall report to the President with respect to these \ndisputes."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2555,
