        "signing_date": "1990-05-03",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12714.txt",
        "text_sha256": "a5b2b495363b0e60a24765138a2113b6ad1367785cd0c6ade29a41a37d747555",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1990-05-08/pdf/FR-1990-05-08.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. Maintaining Conditions. From the date of the creation of the board and \nfor 30 days after the board has made its report with respect to these disputes \nto the President, no change, except by agreement of the parties, shall be made \nby the railroads or the employees in the conditions out of which the disputes \narose."
